sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant AP as Staff Panel
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Note over A,DB: Login
    A->>AP: Enter admin credentials
    AP->>BE: POST /api/admin/login
    BE-->>AP: JWT token (atoken)

    Note over A,DB: Setup Doctor Account
    A->>AP: Fill doctor registration form
    AP->>BE: POST /api/admin/add-doctor
    BE->>DB: Create doctor document
    BE-->>AP: Doctor created

    Note over A,DB: Assign Clinics to Doctors
    A->>AP: Select clinic & doctors
    AP->>BE: POST /api/admin/assign-clinic-doctors
    BE->>DB: Update clinic assignments
    BE-->>AP: Success

    Note over A,DB: View Analytics
    A->>AP: Open dashboard / financial analytics
    AP->>BE: GET /api/admin/dashboard
    AP->>BE: GET /api/admin/financial-analytics
    BE->>DB: Aggregate statistics
    BE-->>AP: Analytics data

    Note over A,DB: Delete User Profile
    A->>AP: Confirm delete user
    AP->>BE: POST /api/admin/delete-user-account
    BE->>DB: Remove / deactivate user
    BE-->>AP: Success
